
@startuml seq_availability

title Hotel Reservation System - Availability Search

autonumber

actor "Guest" as Guest
participant "React Frontend" as UI
participant "FastAPI Backend" as API
participant "Availability Service" as AS
database "PostgreSQL Database" as DB

== Enter Search Information ==

Guest -> UI: Enter check-in, check-out,\nguest count and optional room type
UI -> API: GET /api/availability
activate API

API -> API: Validate dates, guest count,\nand optional room type filter

alt Invalid Search Input
    API --> UI: 422 Unprocessable Entity
    UI --> Guest: Display validation error

else Valid Search Input

    API -> AS: Search availability
    activate AS

    AS -> AS: Get current server time

    AS -> DB: Query room types matching\nguest capacity and optional filter
    DB --> AS: Matching room types

    loop For each matching Room Type

        AS -> DB: Get eligible physical-room inventory
        DB --> AS: Room inventory information

        AS -> DB: Get overlapping reservations\nand Pending holds
        DB --> AS: Reservation dates, statuses,\nand hold expiration times

        loop For each night of requested stay

            AS -> AS: Count inventory-consuming\nConfirmed and CheckedIn bookings

            AS -> AS: Count Pending holds\nwhere expires_at > server time

            AS -> AS: Calculate remaining room units

        end

        AS -> AS: Find minimum available units\nacross all requested nights

        alt Available units >= 1
            AS -> AS: Add Room Type to results
        else No available units
            AS -> AS: Exclude Room Type
        end

    end

    AS --> API: Available room types and rates
    deactivate AS

    API --> UI: 200 OK + available room types
    UI --> Guest: Display available rooms

end

deactivate API

note over AS, DB
Date ranges overlap when:
existing.check_in < requested.check_out
AND
existing.check_out > requested.check_in

Check-out date is exclusive.
Expired Pending holds do not consume inventory.
Future Out-of-Order inventory rules are TBD.
end note

note over UI, API
Availability search does not create a hold.
Increment 5 must atomically recheck
inventory before creating a Pending hold.
end note

@enduml
